MODULE: FloorAdvancesNeverBanks
TARGET: FloorAdvances
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a drive with timely storage never banks any pin progress
PERTURBS: DriveOpportunity

--- FIND
        ![l].pin = IF timely /\ @ < head THEN @ + 1 ELSE @]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: successful replay discards its banked prefix.
        ![l].pin = @]
--- END
